        "content": "### Required: Replace placeholder API key before running\nOpen **Set Video & API Key** and replace `ytt_live_REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_API_KEY` with your token from [yttotext.com/developers](https://yttotext.com/developers). Otherwise the API returns `401 Unauthorized`.",
